# Cursor AI Architectural Rules (`.cursorrules`)

# Direct Cursor to the Master Architectural Blueprint
Read and adhere strictly to @ARCHITECTURE.md and @AGENTS.md.

# Ignored & Non-Tracked Directories
- .nuxt/
- .output/
- node_modules/
- dist/
- .git/

# Core Conventions
1. Always use `<script setup lang="ts">` in Vue Single-File Components.
2. Zero `any` types permitted. All interfaces, props, and emits must be strictly typed.
3. No direct DOM manipulation. Use Vue Composition API (`ref`, `reactive`, `computed`).
4. Props Down, Emits Up (`defineProps`, `defineEmits`). No in-place mutation of props.
5. Surgical code modifications only. Do not reformat unrelated files.

